      "id": "pt-BR-artigos",
      "level": "A1",
      "title": "Artigos",
      "en": "Definite and indefinite articles",
      "note": "Articles agree with nouns: o livro, a casa, os livros, as casas; um, uma, uns, umas. Articles before possessives and personal names vary by region and context in Brazil: meu livro and o meu livro can both occur. Learn nouns with their gender.",
