      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Possessivos",
      "en": "Possessives and agreement",
      "note": "Possessives agree with what is owned: meu livro, minha casa, meus livros, minhas casas. Seu/sua can refer to você as well as ele/ela; dele/dela often clarifies his or her. Articles before possessives are optional in many Brazilian contexts. Nosso/nossa refers to nós; a gente uses third-person verb agreement.",
