      "id": "pt-BR-perfeito",
      "level": "A2",
      "title": "Pretérito perfeito",
      "en": "Completed actions in the past",
      "note": "The simple pretérito perfeito describes a completed event: Ontem falei com a Ana. Regular -ar forms include falei, falou, falamos, falaram; unlike European falámos, Brazilian falamos has no accent. Regular -er: comi, comeu, comemos, comeram; -ir: parti, partiu, partimos, partiram. Common irregulars include fui, tive, fiz and disse.",
