      "id": "pt-BR-futuro",
      "level": "B1",
      "title": "Futuro",
      "en": "The simple future",
      "note": "Add -ei, -ás, -á, -emos, -eis, -ão to the infinitive: falarei, comerás, partirão. Dizer, fazer and trazer use the shortened stems dir-, far- and trar-. The simple future is common in writing and predictions. Everyday plans often use ir in the present plus infinitive: Vou falar com ela amanhã.",
