      "level": "B1",
      "title": "Futuro do pretérito",
      "en": "Would and polite requests",
      "note": "This tense expresses a hypothetical result, polite request, or a future viewed from the past: eu falaria, você comeria, nós partiríamos. Dizer, fazer and trazer use dir-, far- and trar-. It is also called the conditional. Gostaria de um café is a polite request.",
